    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want another \"tool\" or another way to manage it. i've tried everything. breathing won't stop the world from being so loud. it feels like there's no way to actually achieve peace in this life. like the only way to get that true, absolute silence where everything finally just stops and goes still... is there any way to actually do that? to just... be done with the noise for good?",
